{"date":"2012-10-05","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/f9/84/61216_lZClj.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/f9/84/61216_lZClj.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/f9/84/61216_lZClj.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/f9/84/61216_lZClj.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/f9/84/61216_lZClj.jpg"},"summary":"　　《科学怪狗》是根据波顿1984年拍摄的一部同名短片改编的，也是首部波顿参与制作的迪士尼动画。\r\n　　本片采用黑白单格拍摄，并会后期转制成3D形式，为了配合剧情，制作超过200只木偶和道具。\r\n　　小男孩维克多的爱狗Sparky被车撞死后，他十分伤心。在学校上课的时候，当老师做用电击 青蛙的方法使其神经抽搐的实验时，他有了救活他的小狗的灵感。于是晚上，他引了天上的雷电电击小狗的尸体，使它复活。重生的小狗吓坏了男孩家的邻居们，他们视这只狗为怪物。邻居们追赶狗时将狗和男孩逼进一间小木屋，失手几乎烧死他们。但小狗却将男孩救出，自己死去。邻居和男孩的父母为之感动，决心再次救活它。他们用汽车发动机制造电能，又一次救活了这只狗……","name":"Frankenweenie","name_cn":"科学怪狗","tags":[{"name":"欧美","count":69,"total_count":86164},{"name":"剧场版","count":57,"total_count":718635},{"name":"迪士尼","count":45,"total_count":19449},{"name":"定格动画","count":38,"total_count":3208},{"name":"科幻","count":32,"total_count":250050},{"name":"黑白","count":29,"total_count":585},{"name":"2012","count":27,"total_count":55315},{"name":"动画电影","count":25,"total_count":43522},{"name":"Disney","count":22,"total_count":7561},{"name":"美国动画","count":13,"total_count":2269},{"name":"美国","count":12,"total_count":26989},{"name":"電影","count":9,"total_count":185},{"name":"原创","count":7,"total_count":613877},{"name":"TimBurton","count":7,"total_count":174},{"name":"非日本动画","count":5,"total_count":59},{"name":"奇幻","count":4,"total_count":463793},{"name":"电影","count":3,"total_count":13496},{"name":"米国","count":2,"total_count":135},{"name":"2010-2019","count":2,"total_count":2170},{"name":"蒂姆伯顿","count":2,"total_count":225},{"name":"2010s","count":2,"total_count":5581},{"name":"动画","count":1,"total_count":35443},{"name":"JohnAugust","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"MartinShort","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"アニメ映画","count":1,"total_count":2826},{"name":"Walt_Disney_Pictures","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"童年","count":1,"t